OL,3,GNEWSAAmbush attack gang jailed for Dale
OL,4,AMartin killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix members of a masked gang who killed
OL,7,Fa man after setting upon him "like a
OL,8,Fpack of animals" in an armed ambush
OL,9,Fhave been jailed.
OL,11,FDale Martin, also known as DJ, was
OL,12,Fdragged out of a car in Derby in June
OL,13,F2025 and repeatedly stabbed and
OL,14,Fslashed.
OL,16,FOn Friday, Jayden Mannion-Roberts, 26,
OL,17,Fof Tennyson Street in Derby, was given
OL,18,Fa life sentence, with a minimum term of
OL,19,F27 years, for his murder.
